1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,800
From unseen transit risks to Cargo-Aware Autonomy:
Introducing CargoShield AI for cargo transport robots.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:12,500
Reaching the destination does not mean
the cargo was protected along the way.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:19,500
Floor vibrations and varying surfaces pose high risks to fragile items.
CargoShield AI adds a dedicated decision layer for cargo risk assessment.

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:28,500
The system feeds IMU windows into Surface AI for classification,
passes a Confidence Gate, evaluates Vibration Risk, and executes Cargo Policy.

5
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:37,500
The Safety Core acts as the sole deterministic decision maker.
The database sits safely outside the synchronous safety path.

6
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:46,500
In the Mission Protection Console, selecting fragile cargo
automatically applies a cautious speed policy.

7
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:55,500
If the AI model lacks confidence in classification,
the system immediately enters HOLD UNCERTAIN to avoid guessing.

8
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:06,500
When obstacles or hazards are detected, it triggers a latched SAFE STOP
until manually resumed by an operator.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,800
Camera viewports support Overview, Follow, and Robot POV
for real-time mission monitoring.

10
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:23,500
For fleet operators, Fleet Guardian provides multi-robot status monitoring,
Safety Event logging, and mission history tracking.

11
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:33,500
Featuring a deterministic, read-only Maintenance Assistant (human approval required),
with Hermes provider not connected.

12
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:41,500
CargoShield is verified by 177 automated tests,
14/14 MQTT end-to-end checks, and 12/12 fleet scenario tests.

13
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:47,500
On a held-out dataset, the model achieves 72.1% selective accuracy,
prioritizing safe stops over low confidence predictions.

14
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:55,500
Currently, CargoShield operates as a Software Prototype using Dataset Replay.
Live BMI270, mTLS, OPTIGA Enclave, and Secure Boot represent our proposed design.

15
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,800
CargoShield AI
Protect the cargo. Explain every decision.
